{"id": "EUVD-2026-82011", "enisaUuid": "a06821c3-ae72-33f8-99d9-e17fecbfce83", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwifi: mt76: reject out-of-range link ids in mt76_vif_link()\n\nmt76_vif_link() indexes mvif->link[] without validating link_id, but\ncallers pass mvif->deflink_id / msta->deflink_id, which hold\nIEEE80211_LINK_UNSPECIFIED (0xf) until the first link has been added.\nSince IEEE80211_MLD_MAX_NUM_LINKS is 15, that reads one element past the\nend of the array, aliasing mt76_vif_data.offchannel_link.\n\nReachable via mt7996_set_tsf()/mt7996_offset_tsf() and\nmt7996_net_fill_forward_path(). Bounds check link_id and return NULL,\nmatching mt7996_sta_link() and mt7996_sta_link_protected().", "datePublished": "2026-09-17T16:08:58", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:02:06", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/13f6a9c786022d5213e84d494cc8717c378f5395", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c1442c345ca8da857fadea1d0797b97347ab6984", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9ba744a28c26eaa5cae930688a22e01888395308"], "aliases": ["GHSA-2wwg-wpch-pp6g", "CVE-2026-90350"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "179c073c-0331-31ed-aa3e-68da42ae201f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "a9384b36a42afc2d715eb74c19a7ee558f09ef82 <13f6a9c786022d5213e84d494cc8717c378f5395"}, {"id": "361c447d-3ec3-3ae1-a5f0-687fa9e51446", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.15"}, {"id": "49319e22-337e-3746-b6ec-ff49a791d5fe", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "528e8789-8455-3ac1-a9f6-ee02668b4edf", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.52"}, {"id": "5cf205f3-5ebc-30fd-af33-55bd779934a3", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.6"}, {"id": "772a19ac-c28b-3f65-ab90-8ce7eb731667", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "a9384b36a42afc2d715eb74c19a7ee558f09ef82 <9ba744a28c26eaa5cae930688a22e01888395308"}, {"id": "b800cbc0-306c-376b-a951-3ad9cd18c2d9", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "a9384b36a42afc2d715eb74c19a7ee558f09ef82 <c1442c345ca8da857fadea1d0797b97347ab6984"}, {"id": "c96013df-6a72-3dad-9ab1-3a2950187abe", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "7618e6fb-a7d5-375a-bdb1-dce6b6790091", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}